DESCRIPTION:In January of 2026\, the Duke Health Plans introduced a new Hi
 gh Deductible Health Plan (HDHP)- Duke Advantage plan that is paired with
  a Health Savings Account (HSA) administered by Fidelity Investments. \n\
 nWhether you are currently enrolled in the Duke Advantage plan and want t
 o better understand how it works\, or you are considering enrolling durin
 g Open Enrollment for 2027\, this session is designed to help you get the
  most value from your coverage.\n\nJoin our webinar on Wednesday May 20th
  to learn:\n\n - Key features of the Duke Advantage HDHP\n - How the Heal
 th Savings Account works\n - Tips to make the plan work for you and your 
 covered dependents.\n\nRegister in advance for this meeting using the Mor
 e Event Information link.\n\nAfter registering\, you will receive a confi
 rmation email containing information about joining the meeting.
DURATION:PT1H
